column2:
Sailor:<nl>
 The fog's so thick here I can hardly
 see my hand in front of me.{END}

Captain:<nl>
 Men!
 Hoist the sails!{END}

column1:
船長
「帰りたい時はいつでも声をかけ
　てくれよ」{END}

column2:
Captain:<nl>
 Well, just let me know when you
 want to.{END}

Captain:<nl>
 If ya ain't got the cash, we ain't
 going anywhere.{END}

Captain:<nl>
 Men!
 Raise the sails!{END}

column1:
船乗り
「こんなド田舎、早くおさらばし
　たいよ」{END}

column2:
Sailor:<nl>
 I can't wait 'til we say goodbye to
 this backwater dump!{END}

Chef:<nl>
 What!?
 How can you reject this taste!?{END}

“It is within the black, the flame,
the shadow of darkness, that there
is glimmering light.”{END}

